# 32x16x16 wall-bounded box (2pi x 2pi x 1) seeded with a Taylor-Green field so the SGS model and
# wall model see genuinely 3D gradients: KEP advection, AMD SGS with the adaptive wall-model filter, log-law wall model, constant body
# force, one passive scalar with a Dirichlet wall value.
GEO_SRC=examples/RayleighBernard/RB.geo
GEO_SED='s/^Nx = .*/Nx = 32;/;s/^Ny = .*/Ny = 16;/;s/^Nz = .*/Nz = 16;/;s/^Lx = .*/Lx = 6.283185307179586;/;s/^Ly = .*/Ly = 6.283185307179586;/'
